        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa hamafuku akukuminina antu amba kamona mpidi yetala daYehova yinashimati dehi hewulu damapidi, yakasompoka mpidi janyanya; kwakahwila nyuza yawantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuza yayivulu yakaya nakuhosha nawu, Tuyenu, twakakanduki kumpidi yaYehova, nikwitala daNzambi yaYakoba; akatu leji mwaya yaaku yindi kulonda twakendaŋa munjila jindi. MuZiyona mwakafuma nshimbi, kuYerusalema kwakafuma izu daYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakekala hakachi kanyuza yayivulu nakuyisompesha, wakahoshola nyuza yaŋovu yidi kwakulehi; mpoku jawu jatubali akajichila matemwa, mayoŋawu akayichila nyipanŋa. Muza hiwakanyamwina muza wukwawu mpoku yakabaluku, hiyakadiza nawa cheŋi njitaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa kashakama iwu mwishina damuvinyu windi, iwu mwishina dachikuyu chindi kwosi wakayitiyisha womaku. Muloŋa kanwa kaYehova wamazaza kanahoshumu dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa nyuza yawantu yejima yakenda, iwu mwijina damukishi wawu, iwu mwijina damukishi wawu, hakwila etu twakendaŋa mwijina daYehova Nzambi yetu chahaya nyaka nanyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Hefuku odu nakapompesha abalakataŋa, nakakumaŋeja cheŋi ahaŋawu dehi, ninawa inamweshi dehi ihuŋu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abalakatilaŋa nakayibalumuna kwikala akushalahu, akinjikewa kwakulehi nakayibalumuna ekali muza waŋovu; Yehova wakekala Mwanta wawu kumpidi yaZiyona, kufumisha henohu nichahaya nyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi kaposhi kamukanka wanyikoku, eyi mpidi yamwana kaZiyona wamumbanda, wakenza kudeyi, wanta wakusambila wakenza, wanta wamwana kaYerusalema wamumbanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudi nakukalokeladi nyiteti? Mukachi kenu himudi mwantaku? Mukwakuyileja maana nanoŋi dehi, mwaka mutiyaloŋa nyisoŋu yidi neyi yamumbanda wudi nakufunyisha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana kaZiyona wamumbanda, tiyaku nyisoŋu, kabakanaku wuvwali neyi mumbanda wudi nakufunyisha. Katataka wakafuma mumukala, wakashakama mumpata, wakashika nikuBabilonia diku kwakakupulwishilawu; diku kwakakukuulayi Yehova kudi ayilumbu jeyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
